युत लाईन जडान गरिदिनु हुन&nbsp; सिफारिस साथ अनुरोध छ।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">तपशिल:</span></p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1.0pt solid black;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.7in;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">जिल्ला</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:109.2pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">गा.वि.स./नगर</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.8pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:76.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">नक्सा सि.नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:63.0pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">कि.नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:103.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">क्षेत्रफल</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.7in;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:109.2pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.8pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:76.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:63.0pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:103.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">जग्गाको चारकिल्ला:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">पूर्व –&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">पश्चिम –&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">उत्तर –&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">दक्षिण –</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">…………………………………..</span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा अध्यक्ष</span></p>',
        1, '2023-02-14 07:45:04', '2023-02-14 08:53:35', NULL),
       (41, 1, 24, 'भूमिसुधार तथा मालपोत कार्यालय',
        '<p><span class=\"text-big\">पत्र संख्याः&nbsp;२०७९/०८०&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><span class=\"text-big\">चलानी नं.&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; लुम्बिनी प्रदेश,&nbsp;नेपाल</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;मिति:२०७७/०४/०७&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>श्री भूमिसुधार तथा मालपोत कार्यालय,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;नेपालगंज, बाँके ।&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\"><u>&nbsp;</u></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\"><u>बिषयः सिफारिस सम्बन्धमा।</u></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">उपरोक्त सम्बन्धमा जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज उप-महानगरपालिका वडा नं. 8 निवासी ............ ले निजको नाममा दर्ता स्रेस्ता रहेको तपशिल बमोजिमको जग्गामा ........ सालमा घर बनाई निरन्तर रुपमा बसोबास गर्दै आएको र सो जग्गाको जग्गा धनी पुर्जामा घर कायम नभएको हुँदा जग्गा धनी पुर्जामा घर कायम गराई पाउन तहाँ कार्यालयको नाममा सिफारिस गरि पाउँ भनि यस वडा कार्यालयमा निवेदन पेश गरेकोमा सो सम्बन्धमा बुझ्दा व्यहोरा मनाशिव खुल्न आएकोले तहाँको नियमानुसार जग्गा धनी पुर्जामा घर कायम गरि दिनु हुन सिफारिस साथ अनुरोध छ।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">तपशिल:</span></p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1.0pt solid black;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.7in;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">जिल्ला</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:109.2pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">गा.वि.स./नगर</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.8pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:76.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">नक्सा सि.नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:63.0pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">कि.नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:103.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">क्षेत्रफल</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.7in;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:109.2pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.8pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:76.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:63.0pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:103.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\"><strong>…………………………………….</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\"><strong>वडा अध्यक्ष</strong></span></p>',
        1, '2023-02-14 07:51:29', '2023-02-14 08:52:59', NULL),
       (42, 1, 23, 'घरबाटो सिफारिश',
        '<p><span class=\"text-big\">पत्र संख्याः&nbsp;२०७९/०८०&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><span class=\"text-big\">चलानी नं.&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; लुम्बिनी प्रदेश,&nbsp;नेपाल</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">मिति :२०७९/०८/२५&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"text-big\">श्री भूमिसुधार तथा मालपोत कार्यालय,&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">नेपालगंज, बाँके।&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">बिषय : घरबाटो सिफारिश।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज उ.म.न.पा. वडा नं. ८ निवासी <strong>......................</strong>को<strong>&nbsp;</strong>नाममा दर्ता स्रेस्ता रहेको जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज नगर, वा.नं. ११, नक्सा सि.नं. ..............., कि.नं. ....., क्षेत्रफल ......... व.मि. जग्गाको घरबाटो तपसिलमा उल्लेखित विवरण अनुसार भएको व्यहोरा सिफारिश साथ अनुरोध छ।</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>घरबाटोको विवरण</strong></span></p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1.0pt solid black;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.55in;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">क्र.सं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.95in;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:67.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">सिट नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:49.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">कित्ता नं.</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:58.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">क्षेत्रफल</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:67.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">घर भएको/</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">नभएको</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:74.8pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">बाटोको प्रकार</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:48.1pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:114.2pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">कैफियत</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.55in;\"><span class=\"text-big\">१</span></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:.95in;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">नेपालगंज उ.म.न.पा.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">- ८ (साविक-....)</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:67.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:49.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:58.5pt;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:67.5pt;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:74.8pt;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;height:157.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:114.2pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">यसमा उल्लेखित&nbsp;कि.नं. ...………क्षेत्रफल ....………. को&nbsp;जग्गामा ..…... घर भएको र ........... बाटो भएको व्यहोरा ................ प्रयोजनको लागि सिफारिश गरिएको छ।</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा अध्यक्ष</span></p>',
        1, '2023-02-14 08:01:57', '2023-02-14 08:52:17', NULL),
       (43, 1, 22, 'घरेलु तथा साना उद्योग कार्यालय',
        '<p><span class=\"text-big\">पत्र संख्याः&nbsp;२०७९/०८०&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><span class=\"text-big\">चलानी नं.&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; लुम्बिनी प्रदेश,&nbsp;नेपाल</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">मिति :२०७९/०९/०१&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">श्री घरेलु तथा साना उद्योग कार्यालय ,</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">नेपालगंज, बाँके।</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\"><u>बिषय: सिफारिश सम्बन्धमा</u>।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">उपरोक्त सम्बन्धमा जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज उप-महानगरपालिका, वडा नं. ८ निवासी <strong>..................</strong>ले<strong>&nbsp;</strong>...................को नाममा दर्ता स्रेस्ता रहेको <strong>जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज नगर, वडा नं. ...., नक्सा सि.नं. ......................., कि.नं. ...., क्षेत्रफल .................</strong>को घरजग्गामा <strong>................&nbsp; </strong>नामको व्यवसाय संचालन गर्न गई रहेको हुँदा सो व्यवसाय दर्ताको लागि तहाँ&nbsp; कार्यालयको नाममा सिफारिश गरि पाउँ&nbsp; भनि यस वडा कार्यालयमा निवेदन पेश गरेकोमा सो सम्बन्धमा तहाँको नियमानुसार निवेदकको माग बमोजिमको व्यवसाय दर्ता गरि दिनु हुन सिफारिश साथ अनुरोध छ ।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">…………………..………………..</span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा अध्यक्ष</span></p>',
        1, '2023-02-14 08:06:58', '2023-02-14 08:51:46', NULL),
       (44, 1, 21, 'आपूर्ति तथा उपभोक्ता संरक्षण कार्यालय',
        '<p><span class=\"text-big\">पत्र संख्याः&nbsp;२०७९/०८०&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><span class=\"text-big\">चलानी नं.&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;लुम्बिनी प्रदेश,&nbsp;नेपाल</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">मिति :२०७९/०९/०१&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"text-big\">श्री वाणिज्य, आपूर्ति तथा उपभोक्ता संरक्षण कार्यालय,</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">नेपालगंज, बाँके।</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\"><u>बिषय: सिफारिश सम्बन्धमा</u>।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">उपरोक्त सम्बन्धमा जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज उप-महानगरपालिका, वडा नं. ८ निवासी <strong>..................</strong>ले<strong>&nbsp;</strong>...................को नाममा दर्ता स्रेस्ता रहेको <strong>जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज नगर, वडा नं. ...., नक्सा सि.नं. ......................., कि.नं. ...., क्षेत्रफल .................</strong>को घरजग्गामा <strong>................&nbsp; </strong>नामको व्यवसाय संचालन गर्न गई रहेको हुँदा सो व्यवसाय दर्ताको लागि तहाँ कार्यालयको नाममा सिफारिश गरि पाउँ&nbsp; भनि यस वडा कार्यालयमा निवेदन पेश गरेकोमा सो सम्बन्धमा तहाँको नियमानुसार निवेदकको माग बमोजिमको व्यवसाय दर्ता गरि दिनु हुन सिफारिश साथ अनुरोध छ ।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">…………………………………….</span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा अध्यक्ष</span></p>',
        1, '2023-02-14 08:10:19', '2023-02-14 08:51:16', NULL);
