       (46, 1, 19, 'नाम थर/जन्म मिति फरक पर्न गएको',
        '<p><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; पत्र संख्याः&nbsp;२०७९/०८०&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">&nbsp; चलानी नं.&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>लुम्बिनी प्रदेश,&nbsp;नेपाल</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">मिति:२०७९/०९/२५&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"text-big\">श्री जो जस संग सम्बन्ध राख्दछ,</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">बिषयः सिफारिश सम्बन्धमा।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">उपरोक्त सम्बन्धमा जिल्ला बाँके, नेपालगंज उप-महानगरपालिका वडा नं. ८ बस्ने&nbsp;<strong>........... </strong>ले निजको&nbsp;तपशिल बमोजिमका कागजपत्रहरुमा नाम थर/जन्म मिति फरक पर्न गएकोले सो फरक पर्न गएको नामथर भएको व्यक्ति एकै भएको व्यहोरा सिफारिश गरि पाउँ यस वडा कार्यालयमा निवेदन पेश गरेकोमा सो सम्बन्धमा बुझ्दा व्यहोरा मनासिव खुल्न आएकोले सो फरक नामथर भएको व्यक्ति एकै भएको व्यहोरा सिफारिस साथ अनुरोध छ।&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"text-big\">तपशिल:</span></p><figure class=\"table\"><table style=\";\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1.0pt solid black;height:22.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:148.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">हुनु पर्ने नाम थर/जन्म मिति</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:22.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:184.5pt;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">फरक परेको नाम थर/जन्म मिति</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:22.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:1.75in;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"text-big\">फरक परेको विवरण</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:148.5pt;\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:184.5pt;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:1.75in;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:black;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:148.5pt;\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:184.5pt;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid black;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid black;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:1.75in;\">