को नातिनी तथा <strong>......................&nbsp;</strong>र <strong>..................&nbsp;</strong>को छोरी <strong>................... </strong>को&nbsp;विवाह <strong>जिल्ला बाँके,</strong> <strong>नेपालगंज उप-महानगरपालिका वडा नं 8&nbsp;</strong>मा <strong>वि.सं.&nbsp;...............</strong>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>मा भएको व्यहोरा प्रमाणित गरिएको छ।</span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">……………………………………………</span></p><p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"text-big\">वडा अध्यक्ष</span></p>',
